    "question": {
      ":question/id": "36f4a446-b5cd-5e57-b1c8-e53b9fe7a93e",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/easy",
      ":question/problem": "Find $(v(t)\\mathbf{f}(t))^{\\prime}$ given that $\\mathbf{f}(t)=⟨\\frac{5^{t}}{25},\\,5^{2 t} + 3,\\,5^{t}⟩$ and $v(t)=5^{- t}.$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the scalar function multiple rule:\n\n$$\n(v(t)\\mathbf{f}(t))^{\\prime}=v(t)\\mathbf{f}^{\\prime}(t)+v^{\\prime}(t)\\mathbf{f}(t)\n$$\n\nWrite intermediate vectors as columns.\n\nDifferentiate each component:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\mathbf{f}^{\\prime}_{1}(t) & =\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}\\left(\\frac{5^{t}}{25}\\right)=\\frac{5^{t} \\ln{(5 )}}{25} \\\\ \\mathbf{f}^{\\prime}_{2}(t) & =\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(5^{2 t} + 3)=2 \\cdot 5^{2 t} \\ln{(5 )} \\\\ \\mathbf{f}^{\\prime}_{3}(t) & =\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(5^{t})=5^{t} \\ln{(5 )} \\\\ \\mathbf{f}^{\\prime}(t) & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5^{t} \\ln{(5 )}}{25} \\\\ 2 \\cdot 5^{2 t} \\ln{(5 )} \\\\ 5^{t} \\ln{(5 )}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ v^{\\prime}(t) & =\\frac{\\mathrm{d}}{\\mathrm{d}t}(5^{- t})=- 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nCalculate the first product-rule term and the second product-rule term, denoted $P_1$ and $P_2$:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P_1 & =(5^{- t})\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5^{t} \\ln{(5 )}}{25} \\\\ 2 \\cdot 5^{2 t} \\ln{(5 )} \\\\ 5^{t} \\ln{(5 )}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{\\ln{(5 )}}{25} \\\\ 2 \\cdot 5^{t} \\ln{(5 )} \\\\ \\ln{(5 )}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\ P_2 & =(- 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )})\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{5^{t}}{25} \\\\ 5^{2 t} + 3 \\\\ 5^{t}\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{\\ln{(5 )}}{25} \\\\ - 5^{t} \\ln{(5 )} - 3 \\cdot 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )} \\\\ - \\ln{(5 )}\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAdd the two terms componentwise:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}(v(t)\\mathbf{f}(t))^{\\prime} & =P_1+P_2 \\\\  & =⟨0,\\,5^{t} \\ln{(5 )} - 3 \\cdot 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )},\\,0⟩\\end{aligned}\n$$",
      ":question/answer-fields": [
        {
          ":answer-field/id": "60e4798d-755b-5aa9-92d4-9ab734bfbcd0",
          ":answer-field/key": "selection",
          ":answer-field/type": ":answer-field.type/radio",
          ":answer-field/choices": [
            {
              ":answer/id": "a4114117-c263-5f1b-8154-170268acd1a4",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "⟨\\frac{\\ln{(5 )}}{50},\\,\\frac{3 \\cdot 5^{t} \\ln{(5 )}}{2} - \\frac{3 \\cdot 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )}}{2},\\,\\frac{\\ln{(5 )}}{2}⟩"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "27f6e2d9-4dcd-5260-ae15-26a025aaedab",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "⟨0,\\,- \\frac{5^{t} \\ln{(5 )}}{2} + \\frac{3 \\cdot 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )}}{2},\\,0⟩"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "3a09ed73-1c9b-5110-88d7-f4102a4ef1bd",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "⟨\\frac{2 \\ln{(5 )}}{25},\\,3 \\cdot 5^{t} \\ln{(5 )} + 3 \\cdot 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )},\\,2 \\ln{(5 )}⟩"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "5bd31078-6eac-5b29-834a-9dd292be107d",
              ":answer/type": ":answer.type/math",
              ":answer/value": "⟨0,\\,5^{t} \\ln{(5 )} - 3 \\cdot 5^{- t} \\ln{(5 )},\\,0⟩"
            },
            {
              ":answer/id": "4849a5e6-89ec-5d52-a01c-81862ab51e09",
